        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary Data from the published literature report the presence of escitalopram and desmethylescitalopram in human milk (see Data ).",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-escitalopram",
          "section": "8.2"
        }
      ]
